title: "2p22.1-tcell: analysis code for a two-sample Mendelian randomization study of 731 immunophenotypes and non-puerperal mastitis"
abstract: "Instrument selection, harmonization, forward and reverse two-sample Mendelian randomization, sensitivity analyses, variant-level screening and figure/table generation for a study of 731 circulating immune-cell phenotypes and non-puerperal mastitis in FinnGen release 11."
